{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114483","id":3139769787,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67JRW7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114483","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114483.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114483.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114483","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114483/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114483/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114483/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/298affa02518352a2d7d7954841a71bb5b2901d6","number":114483,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix Android export with multiple architectures failing when GDExtension includes native dependencies","user":{"login":"ej-sanmartin","id":29460583,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NDYwNTgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29460583?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin","html_url":"https://github.com/ej-sanmartin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ej-sanmartin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #111407\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n\r\nThe dependency lookup is defined in a lambda using `p_features` which contains all architectures, so dependencies for every architecture were being added during each architecture's pass and thus causing duplicates.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nThis PR uses `features_wo_arch` and the current `arch_tag` instead, so dependencies are only resolved for the architecture being processed.\r\n\r\n## Tested\r\n\r\nBuilt Godot locally for macOS, exported w/ Android preset and `armeabi-v7a` (`arm32`), `arm64-v8a` (`arm64`) target architectures selected, and built an `.apk` successfully.\r\n\r\nRelevant logs captured:\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\nADDING: kotlin/reflect/reflect.kotlin_builtins\r\nSigning binary using: \r\n/Users/ed/Library/Android/sdk/build-tools/35.0.0/apksigner sign --verbose --ks <REDACTED> --ks-pass pass:<REDACTED> --ks-key-alias <REDACTED> /Users/ed/Downloads/test0/test.apk\r\nSigned\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://a